e": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The checkout-api hotfix v2.3.2 is now live in all three production regions, and I opened SEV3 incident INC-0001 to record the change.\n\n- **Before:** All regions were running v2.3.1, which was unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- **Approval:** v2.3.2 had never run in production, so policy required change-manager approval. The deploy went to them automatically and they approved it before it rolled out.\n- **After:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.2. The service is healthy and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 records the deploy, the before and after numbers, the approval, and v2.3.0 as the version to roll back to if needed. It was approved, and opening it paged the on-call engineer.", "type": "text"}]}]}